    "body": "> Open question: What should happen with case where the real parse is in the scripting disabled mode? (E.g. XHR.)\r\n\r\nCan't the prescan also parse with scripting disabled mode in those cases?\r\n\r\n(I wonder if we should eliminate the scripting enabled/disabled parse modes and always parse as scripting enabled.)",
