    "body": "> I think we need to reconsider the authoring conformance requirements here.\r\n\r\nI'm confused why any of the changes proposed here or that you're implementing in Firefox would have any impact on authoring conformance requirements, i.e. what we consider best practice and want to promote for authors.",
